        law: "invManslaughter",
        threshold: 10,
        spec: "Unlawfully and unintentionally killed {V} by culpable negligence in firing a shotgun at an unidentified target near a public boat ramp.",
        ages: 25...60,
        victim: true,
        summary: "At first light on {DATE}, {D} fired a shotgun from a duck blind at a shape on the lake. It was {V}, who was fishing from a boat under a camouflage tarp, and {V} died of the shot. The blind was less than 200 yards from a public boat ramp, and hunting hours had not yet begun. {DL} says {D.he} saw a low shape in the mist and thought it was a raft of ducks.",
